      "id": "sol.amc-8-2024-p2.live",
      "kind": "proof-sketch",
      "text": "We can simplify the fractions by taking out the common factor \\(11\\): \\( \\dfrac{44}{11} \\) simplifies to \\( 4 \\), \\( \\dfrac{110}{44} \\) simplifies to \\( \\dfrac{10}{4} = \\dfrac{5}{2} = 2.5 \\), and \\( \\dfrac{44}{1100} \\) simplifies to \\( \\dfrac{4}{100} = 0.04 \\). Therefore, we have \\( 4 + 2.5 + 0.04 = 6.54.\\)\n\nThus, C is the correct answer.",
